5. PRODUCT OBJECTIVE

BuildIt is an AI website-generation platform.

A user should be able to:

1. Visit BuildIt.
2. Understand what it does.
3. Sign up.
4. Describe the website they want.
5. Enter business/site information.
6. Generate a website using AI.
7. Enter a visual website builder.
8. See the website live.
9. Modify it visually.
10. Ask AI to modify it.
11. Preview desktop/tablet/mobile.
12. Save changes.
13. Version the project.
14. Publish the website.
15. Export the project.
16. Manage projects.
17. Upgrade their hosting plan.
18. Eventually connect a custom domain.

Build the architecture around this complete user journey.

